      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks for that. it's heavy stuff. to make sure i'm getting the whole picture for my research, can u explain what the french government's perspective was? like, what were their legal or political reasons for trying to keep algeria as part of france instead of letting them go? i want to understand why they felt it was necessary to stay.",
